  "body": "Independent follow-up `W10-SV3-SKEPTIC-CALF-BLOOD-WORDING` is confirmed against published W10 head `c9a96da71a1977014680e5a92e600dfc7e3874db`. This is a minor explanation error in proposal `sv1-bio-calf_blood_togo_m2854`, case 44; the source-supported blood identity and broader blood mapping remain intact.\n\nThe active notes, mapping-evidence explanation and proposal description say \u201cCalf age class distinguishes it from serum.\u201d Age and material fraction are separate attributes: calf serum also exists. The exact [TOGO M2854 recipe](https://togomedium.org/sparqlist/api/gmdb_medium_by_gmid?gm_id=M2854) names **calf blood** at a literal 10% receiving dose. It does not explicitly say \u201cwhole,\u201d specify a percentage basis, or establish defibrination, lysis or a commercial product. The root readback verified the committed source capture `12f6464a1dcc66a32160e85433034cfd067ea5e930f3ae6d12ce2c60d6af2770` and selected payload `62f0dc3300c488be2fb9d52f2c65e8e6826715d81177cf8e4ce48af422ed7338`.\n\nBounded correction: state that the source names calf blood, a blood material rather than serum, while calf specifies developmental origin. Correct current explanatory fields and any exact active case/proposal reasoning that repeats the error. Preserve the original historical event verbatim and append a truthful correction event. Keep the source label, identifier, mapping, unknown processing, unknown percentage basis, source-specific applicability, nonresolving generic label and all role/export holds unchanged. Do not infer a new product or expand aliases.\n\nThis was disclosed by a separate skeptical reviewer before any fix; the provenance-only correction did not endorse the inherited wording. Make an immutable successor with exact changed-field accounting, native checks and independent review. Current issue search found no separate calf-blood wording tracker, so this follow-up stays on the existing family issue. Private evidence and the original finding are retained under `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/w10-calf-wording-triage-v1/`.\n"
